Sorry about the misinformation. I remembered incorrectly the number of 
items and failed to mention that stackable items might be generated in 
large quantity than 1.

Chest can have 0-5 items, large boxes 0-3 and all bags 0-1. Ice boxes 
can have 0-20 corpses.

When random item is generated missiles are generated in quantity of 
6-11, food items except corpses and meat rings, gems except loadstones, 
luckstones and rocks(1) are generated in quantity of 1 or 2 and candles 
in quantity of 1-7.

(1) No rocks are generated in containers. If the item generated randomly 
is a rock it's changed into non-stone gem with quantity of 1. Normal 
random rock generation generates them in quantity of 6-11.

